<title>USA: Advanced Plant postpones share split.</title>
<headline>Advanced Plant postpones share split.</headline>
<dateline>MONSEY, N.Y. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Plant Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it postponed a two-for-one forward split of its common stock to September 20.</p>
<p>The company said it postponed the split because the paperwork was not done on time.</p>
<p>The new record date for shareholders would be September 17 at 1700 local (2100 GMT), it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
